{"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/LoginExchange\/finish(password:ke2:ksf:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"finish","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"password","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ke2","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ksf","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/KsfParams","text":"KsfParams","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9KsfParamsV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A failure here is the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"whole"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" of the client’s authentication check, and covers both","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"halves of the mutual authentication: the envelope only opens under the right password, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KE2"},{"text":"’s MAC only verifies if the server actually holds the record. Nothing may be sent","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"afterwards (§23.4 rule 7).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the caller is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"finished","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is a separate question, and one this type deliberately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not answer: under an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"optional"},{"type":"text","text":" tenant a failure here is the ordinary case for an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"account that has no registration record yet, and §23.4 rule 7 requires a retry over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/auth\/login"},{"type":"text","text":". That branch needs the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mode"},{"type":"text","text":" field from the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"login\/start"},{"type":"text","text":" response, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it lives in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AxiamClient.loginOpaque"},{"type":"text","text":" where the response is; the error raised here is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same one either way."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That case is an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", unlike every other refusal in this package. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinction is the point: a wrong password, an account that does not exist and a server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that does not hold the record are indistinguishable by design and are all authentication"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"failures, whereas a key-stretching function this build cannot perform is a configuration"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"problem, and reporting it as “invalid password” would send an operator looking in the wrong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" when the envelope does not open or ","type":"text"},{"code":"KE2","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does not verify.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note"},{"name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/network(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" if the exchange is already spent, or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key-stretching function is one this SDK cannot ask for.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Opens the envelope, producing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KE3"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/LoginExchange"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK13LoginExchangeC6finish8password3ke23ksfS2S_SSAA9KsfParamsVtKF","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"finish","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"password","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ke2","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ksf","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9KsfParamsV","text":"KsfParams","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"finish(password:ke2:ksf:)"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/loginexchange\/finish(password:ke2:ksf:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamError/auth(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamerror\/auth(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"auth","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"AuthError","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9AuthErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"AxiamError.auth(_:)","abstract":[{"text":"Authentication failure: wrong credentials, expired session, MFA failure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or a 401 on the refresh call itself.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/KsfParams":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/KsfParams","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KsfParams"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/ksfparams","abstract":[{"text":"The key-stretching function and cost a ","type":"text"},{"code":"\/start","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" response names (CONTRACT.md §23.4).","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"KsfParams"}],"title":"KsfParams","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamError/network(_:)":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/network(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamerror\/network(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"network","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12NetworkErrorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NetworkError"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Transport-level failure: connection refused, timeout, TLS error, DNS failure,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"malformed request, server (5xx) error."}],"kind":"symbol","title":"AxiamError.network(_:)"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/LoginExchange/finish(password:ke2:ksf:)":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"finish"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"password"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"ke2"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"ksf"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"KsfParams","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9KsfParamsV"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Opens the envelope, producing ","type":"text"},{"code":"KE3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/LoginExchange\/finish(password:ke2:ksf:)","title":"finish(password:ke2:ksf:)","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/loginexchange\/finish(password:ke2:ksf:)"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"AxiamSDK","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/LoginExchange":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LoginExchange"}]